  "issue": {
    "body": "When accessing the `app` property in a `TestClient` or `Request` instance, there could be better support for autocompletion by annotating the fields.\r\n\r\n- `class TestClient(requests.Session)` currently has `self.app = asgi_app`\r\n- `class HTTPConnection(Mapping)` currently has `def app(self) -> typing.Any:`\r\n\r\nWhile I am not sure how better annotations would look like, I would appreciate them.\r\n\r\n(First raised in https://github.com/tiangolo/fastapi/issues/632)",
